exports[`체험 아닌 방문 웰컴 마크업 고정(#249 AC-9) > 인앱 칸 — iOS·Android 1`] = `"<div class="motion-safe:animate-in motion-safe:fade-in-0 motion-safe:duration-200"><div class="space-y-5"><div class="text-center space-y-1"><h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-balance break-keep">자산 등록은 <span class="whitespace-nowrap">Chrome·Safari에서</span> 시작해요</h2><p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground text-pretty break-keep">이 화면에서는 입력한 내용이 사라질 수 있어요.</p></div><div class="flex justify-center"><button data-slot="button" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-medium transition-[color,box-shadow,transform] duration-150 ease-out disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg:not([class*=&#x27;size-&#x27;])]:size-4 shrink-0 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 outline-none focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-ring/50 focus-visible:ring-[3px] aria-invalid:ring-destructive/20 dark:aria-invalid:ring-destructive/40 aria-invalid:border-destructive bg-brand text-white hover:bg-brand/90 dark:shadow-xs h-10 rounded-lg px-6 has-[&gt;svg]:px-4 active:not-disabled:scale-[0.96] w-full gap-2 break-keep sm:w-auto" data-testid="welcome-cta-inapp" aria-controls="welcome-inapp-guide" aria-expanded="false"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-external-link size-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15 3h6v6"></path><path d="M10 14 21 3"></path><path d="M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"></path></svg>외부 브라우저에서 시작하기</button></div></div><div id="welcome-inapp-guide" data-testid="welcome-inapp-guide" role="region" aria-label="외부 브라우저 이동 방법" inert="" class="grid ease-out motion-safe:transition-[grid-template-rows,opacity,visibility] motion-safe:duration-300 grid-rows-[0fr] opacity-0 invisible"><div class="min-h-0 overflow-hidden"><div class="pt-5 text-left break-keep"><div class="flex flex-col gap-4 py-1"><div class="flex items-start gap-2.5 rounded-lg bg-amber-500/10 px-3.5 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400 leading-relaxed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-copy size-4 shrink-0 mt-0.5"><rect width="14" height="14" x="8" y="8" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2"></path></svg><p role="status" data-testid="welcome-inapp-caption" class="text-sm font-semibold break-keep text-pretty">주소가 복사됐어요. 브라우저에 붙여넣어 주세요.</p></div><ol class="space-y-3.5 py-1"><li class="flex items-start gap-3.5 text-sm leading-relaxed"><span class="shrink-0 size-6 rounded-full bg-primary/10 text-primary flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold">1</span><span>화면 우측 상단 또는 하단의 <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 font-semibold text-foreground">메뉴 <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-ellipsis size-3.5"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="1"></circle><circle cx="19" cy="12" r="1"></circle><circle cx="5" cy="12" r="1"></circle></svg></span> 를 누릅니다.</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-3.5 text-sm leading-relaxed"><span class="shrink-0 size-6 rounded-full bg-primary/10 text-primary flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold">2</span><span><span class="font-semibold text-foreground">“다른 브라우저로 열기”</span>(또는 Safari/Chrome으로 열기)를 선택합니다.</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-3.5 text-sm leading-relaxed"><span class="shrink-0 size-6 rounded-full bg-primary/10 text-primary flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold">3</span><span>이동한 브라우저에서 주소로 접속하면 이어집니다.</span></li></ol><div class="rounded-lg bg-muted/40 p-2.5 text-sm text-muted-foreground">메뉴에 위 항목이 보이지 않는다면, 복사된 주소를 복사하여 스마트폰의 기본 브라우저(Safari 또는 크롬) 주소창에 직접 붙여넣어 접속해 주세요.</div></div></div></div></div></div>"`;

exports[`체험 아닌 방문 웰컴 마크업 고정(#249 AC-9) > 인앱 칸 — iOS·Android 2`] = `"<div class="motion-safe:animate-in motion-safe:fade-in-0 motion-safe:duration-200"><div class="space-y-5"><div class="text-center space-y-1"><h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-balance break-keep">자산 등록은 <span class="whitespace-nowrap">Chrome·Safari에서</span> 시작해요</h2><p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground text-pretty break-keep">이 화면에서는 입력한 내용이 사라질 수 있어요.</p></div><div class="flex justify-center"><button data-slot="button" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-medium transition-[color,box-shadow,transform] duration-150 ease-out disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg:not([class*=&#x27;size-&#x27;])]:size-4 shrink-0 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 outline-none focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-ring/50 focus-visible:ring-[3px] aria-invalid:ring-destructive/20 dark:aria-invalid:ring-destructive/40 aria-invalid:border-destructive bg-brand text-white hover:bg-brand/90 dark:shadow-xs h-10 rounded-lg px-6 has-[&gt;svg]:px-4 active:not-disabled:scale-[0.96] w-full gap-2 break-keep sm:w-auto" data-testid="welcome-cta-inapp" aria-controls="welcome-inapp-guide"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-external-link size-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15 3h6v6"></path><path d="M10 14 21 3"></path><path d="M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"></path></svg>외부 브라우저에서 시작하기</button></div></div><div id="welcome-inapp-guide" data-testid="welcome-inapp-guide" role="region" aria-label="외부 브라우저 이동 방법" inert="" class="grid ease-out motion-safe:transition-[grid-template-rows,opacity,visibility] motion-safe:duration-300 grid-rows-[0fr] opacity-0 invisible"><div class="min-h-0 overflow-hidden"><div class="pt-5 text-left break-keep"><div class="flex flex-col gap-4 py-1"><div class="flex items-start gap-2.5 rounded-lg bg-amber-500/10 px-3.5 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400 leading-relaxed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-copy size-4 shrink-0 mt-0.5"><rect width="14" height="14" x="8" y="8" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2"></path></svg><p role="status" data-testid="welcome-inapp-caption" class="text-sm font-semibold break-keep text-pretty">주소가 복사됐어요. 브라우저에 붙여넣어 주세요.</p></div><ol class="space-y-3.5 py-1"><li class="flex items-start gap-3.5 text-sm leading-relaxed"><span class="shrink-0 size-6 rounded-full bg-primary/10 text-primary flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold">1</span><span>화면 우측 상단 또는 하단의 <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 font-semibold text-foreground">메뉴 <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-ellipsis size-3.5"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="1"></circle><circle cx="19" cy="12" r="1"></circle><circle cx="5" cy="12" r="1"></circle></svg></span> 를 누릅니다.</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-3.5 text-sm leading-relaxed"><span class="shrink-0 size-6 rounded-full bg-primary/10 text-primary flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold">2</span><span><span class="font-semibold text-foreground">“다른 브라우저로 열기”</span>(또는 Safari/Chrome으로 열기)를 선택합니다.</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-3.5 text-sm leading-relaxed"><span class="shrink-0 size-6 rounded-full bg-primary/10 text-primary flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold">3</span><span>이동한 브라우저에서 주소로 접속하면 이어집니다.</span></li></ol><div class="rounded-lg bg-muted/40 p-2.5 text-sm text-muted-foreground">메뉴에 위 항목이 보이지 않는다면, 복사된 주소를 복사하여 스마트폰의 기본 브라우저(Safari 또는 크롬) 주소창에 직접 붙여넣어 접속해 주세요.</div></div></div></div></div></div>"`;
